# FitTrack environment variables (all optional).
#
# Exercise demonstrations are on-device SVG animations by default, so the app
# runs with no configuration. To upgrade them to real looping GIFs from
# ExerciseDB (RapidAPI), provide a key:
#
#   1. Subscribe to ExerciseDB at https://rapidapi.com/justin-WFnsXH_t6/api/exercisedb
#   2. Copy this file to `.env` and set the key below.
#
# Without a key, the built-in animations are used (no network needed).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are inlined into the app at build time by Expo.

EXPO_PUBLIC_EXERCISEDB_API_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_EXERCISEDB_HOST=exercisedb.p.rapidapi.com
